### Quick test for Semantic Kernel endpoints
# Notes:
# - Start the service with `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` set (or run via Aspire).
# - Adjust `@baseUrl` if your service is hosted on a different port or behind the gateway.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@model = gpt-4o-mini

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### LLM query - POST /api/sk/query
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sk/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Write a short, 2-sentence summary about ERP microservices and their responsibilities.",
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "temperature": 0.2,
  "maxTokens": 200
}

### Plugin invocation - POST /api/sk/invoke (Orders.Create example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sk/invoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skill": "Orders",
  "function": "Create",
  "input": {
    "orderNumber": "TEST-001",
    "type": "Transfer",
    "sourceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
  }
}
